{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"沉在满足里、安静下来觉得舒服、心思飘远都是内在状态，没有把珠子里的假设性交谈或说过重要的话写成真实事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"盼亲近长久和意识到对方是否同样珍惜自己并非由己决定，都是心理事实，没有新增具体关系、往事或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"偶尔想知道自己是否特别、尚未向对方索取答复以及自在受到干扰，都属于心理变化，没有把珠子里的短促声音写成真实倾诉，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前段觉得现有的亲近与关心已经足够、不必反复确认心意，能够解释他为什么在安静下来时仍感到舒服，可以放松地走神。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"已经满足却舍不得亲近过去、甚至想让这一刻慢下来，自然会进一步盼望它长久，而长久的愿望也使对方的心意是否同样坚定成为问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前段提供了原先不必确认、觉得这样就够的自在状态，能解释这种自在为何会被打断，但新念头为什么出现主要依赖本段对长久的期待，而不是 S02-2 本身。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只看线也能读出从满足而放松，到希望长久并意识到自己无法掌控对方的心意，再到偶尔想确认自己是否特别、原有自在受到干扰的心理推进。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R11\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"R11 中“自己能决定怎样珍惜对方”这一半实质内容没有保留；“一想到长久，便想到对方是否也珍惜自己并非由己决定”的触发关系也被“也知道”弱化成了并列。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S03-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“沉在……满足里”复述了 S02-3 已经说过的满足感；“还”虽然表示这种状态延续到了此刻，但前半句仍有重复，可以把重点留给本段新增的安静舒服与心思飘远。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S03-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条同时写了尚未索取、偶尔想知道自己是否特别、念头打断自在三层心理内容，分号又把状态与结果串在一起，虽然逻辑成立，但可以拆开以突出主要变化。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9166b7aa-9fbe-493e-ad32-68311a0796d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T082804306558Z", "elapsed_seconds": 459.937, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:35:44.253279+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e46508d71aac571a6d1036da0d50a9485946b620dba676343f4a02125494a98", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T082804306558Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "474e352de0af78ffe15ae1a2e4a3efeaeec8113463292cff6ae92f05bb44e316"}}}
